@startuml
[*] --> IdleState
IdleState --> TaskManagementState : User interacts
TaskManagementState --> TaskSuggestionState : Tasks suggested
TaskSuggestionState --> PersonalizedViewState : View personalized
PersonalizedViewState --> IntegrationState : Integrate with apps
IntegrationState --> TaskManagementState : Continue managing
IntegrationState --> TaskSuggestionState : More suggestions
PersonalizedViewState --> [*] : Final state
@enduml
